<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<qti-assessment-item xmlns="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0 https://purl.imsglobal.org/spec/qti/v3p0/schema/xsd/imsqti_asiv3p0_v1p0.xsd"
  identifier="sat-c1-u25-pensive-yourturn" title="Your Turn: Pensive" adaptive="true" time-dependent="false">

  <qti-response-declaration identifier="RESPONSE" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-correct-response><qti-value>B</qti-value></qti-correct-response>
  </qti-response-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="SCORE" cardinality="single" base-type="float">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>0</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="FEEDBACK" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier"/>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>show_interaction</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>

  <qti-item-body>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="show_interaction" outcome-identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" show-hide="show" class="qti-margin-0">
      <qti-content-body>
        <qti-choice-interaction response-identifier="RESPONSE" shuffle="true" max-choices="1">
          <qti-prompt>Four passengers share a train compartment on an ordinary weekday ride. Which one is pensive?</qti-prompt>
          <qti-simple-choice identifier="A">Marta argues loudly with the conductor about the price of her ticket.</qti-simple-choice>
          <qti-simple-choice identifier="B">Elena sits with an unopened book in her lap, turning over a bittersweet memory of a summer long past.</qti-simple-choice>
          <qti-simple-choice identifier="C">Piotr flips through his tickets and rechecks the connection times over and over, afraid he will miss his transfer.</qti-simple-choice>
          <qti-simple-choice identifier="D">Sam gives his seatmate a cheerful play-by-play of yesterday's match, laughing at every detail.</qti-simple-choice>
        </qti-choice-interaction>
      </qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>

    <qti-feedback-block identifier="correct" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Right — sitting quietly, book unopened, absorbed in a bittersweet memory is the gentle, inward, slightly sad thoughtfulness that pensive describes.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="incorrect" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Arguing over a fare, nervously rechecking tickets, and narrating a match are all loud or busy states of mind. Pensive is the quiet one — Elena drifting through a bittersweet memory.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-A" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Marta arguing loudly over her fare is heated and outward — the opposite of quiet reflection. Pensive people are still and inward, sunk in thought; find the passenger drifting through a wistful memory.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-C" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Piotr frantically rechecking his tickets and connection times is anxious, hurried activity, not calm reflection. Pensive describes slow, quiet thought tinged with melancholy. Who seems to be dwelling on the past?</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-D" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Sam laughing through a cheerful play-by-play is loud, sociable fun in the moment. Pensive requires a quiet, wandering mind — look for the passenger absorbed in a melancholy train of thought.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
  </qti-item-body>

  <qti-response-processing>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if>
        <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-correct identifier="RESPONSE"/></qti-match>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">1</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">completed</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">correct</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-if>
      <qti-response-else>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">0</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">incomplete</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">incorrect</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-else>
    </qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if>
        <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">A</qti-base-value></qti-match>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">FB-A</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-if>
    </qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if>
        <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">C</qti-base-value></qti-match>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">FB-C</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-if>
    </qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if>
        <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">D</qti-base-value></qti-match>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">FB-D</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-if>
    </qti-response-condition>
  </qti-response-processing>
</qti-assessment-item>
